  "minutes": 20,
  "skill": "application",
  "instructions": "Corvid Corp. has **$5,000,000** of apportionable business income and **$200,000** of nonbusiness dividends. Its commercial domicile is State H. Compute its income attributable to State X. Round percentages to two decimals.",
